  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>A vector parallel to the line is <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><br />A vector normal to the plane is <math><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>l</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo></math>&nbsp;the line lies in the plane</p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> Point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>4,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>)</mo></math> also lies in the plane<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>l</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math><br /><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
